From 5b22bf9650d65673b049b97e56428acc2276870e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Matheus Sampaio Queiroga <srherobrine20@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 18 Jul 2026 10:52:37 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 111/187] net: omci: expose managed entity class descriptors

Describe every known ITU managed entity with a category, local support
level and flags, and export the catalog through Generic Netlink.

Remove the stale GENERIC_NETLINK Kconfig selection because Generic
Netlink is part of the networking core rather than a selectable symbol.

Signed-off-by: Matheus Sampaio Queiroga <srherobrine20@gmail.com>
---
